rustyhmmer is a pure-Rust reimplementation of HMMER3's hmmsearch. It is a
derivative work of HMMER and its Easel library, and is distributed under the
same terms as those originals. The original copyright notices and license
terms are reproduced in full below.

Rust port copyright (C) 2026 Sunju Kim <n.e.coli.1822@gmail.com>

